      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/34/1/32/33",
      "text": [
        "ه عن عبد اللّه بن سنان فقد رويته عن أبي- رضي اللّه عنه- عن عبد اللّه بن جعفر الحميريّ، عن أيّوب بن نوح، عن محمّد بن أبي عمير، عن عبد اللّه بن سنان، و هو الّذي ذكر عند الصّادق عليه السّلام فقال: أما إنّه يزيد على السنّ خيرا."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Everything in this book that is narrated from Abdullah ibn Sinan has been transmitted by me from my father - may Allah (swt) be pleased with him - from Abdullah ibn Ja'far Al-Himyari, from Ayyub ibn Nuh, from Muhammad ibn Abi 'Umayr, from Abdullah ibn Sinan. He is the one who was mentioned in the presence of Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as), and the Imam said: \"Indeed, he surpasses old age in goodness.\""
        ]
      }
    },
